== Walkthrough ==

Must be at least Kindly.

You say, 'Hail, Lorekeeper Einar'

Lorekeeper Einar says, 'Greetings to you. I seek one that has chosen the path of monkhood. What do you call yourself?'

You say, 'I am a monk'

Lorekeeper Einar says, 'Good. I had hoped you were one. I have heard that as seeker of the way you are in constant training to push yourself to your physical and mental limits. It is an admirable quality and I wish to aid you. I will provide you with a cap, a tunic, sleeves, bracers, gloves, leggings and boots.'


'''Gems are dropped in various Velious zones while Eroded Leather Armor drops from the higher level giants in Kael Drakkel.'''

'''After turn-in:'''

Lorekeeper Einar smiles warmly as he hands you your reward. 'You have done well, _____.'

<div class="facblock">
* Your faction standing with [[Coldain]] got better.
* Your faction standing with [[Dain Frostreaver IV]] got better.
* Your faction standing with [[Kromzek]] got worse.
* Your faction standing with [[Kromrif]] got worse.
</div>
{{YouGainExperience}}

== Cap ==

''Dialogue needed.''

Einar promises to make you a cap if you bring him three pieces of [[Crushed Coral]] as well as an [[Eroded Leather Cap]].

== Tunic ==

''Dialogue needed.''

Einar promises to make you a tunic if you bring him three [[Flawless Diamond]]s and an [[Eroded Leather Tunic]].

== Sleeves ==

''Dialogue needed.''

Einar promises to make you some sleeves if you bring him three [[Flawed Emerald]]s and a set of [[Eroded Leather Sleeves]].

== Bracer ==

You say, 'I want bracers'

Lorekeeper Einar says, 'For the bracers, I will require a [[Eroded Leather Bracelet|eroded leather bracelet]] as well as three [[Crushed Flame Emerald|crushed flame emeralds]]. Return to me when you find such things.'

== Gloves ==

''Dialogue needed.''

Einar promises to make you some gloves if you bring him three [[Crushed Topaz]] and a pair of [[Eroded Leather Gloves]].

== Leggings ==

''Dialogue needed.''

Einar promises to make you some leggings if you bring him a set of old [[Eroded Leather Leggings]] and three [[Flawed Sea Sapphire]]s.

== Boots ==

''Dialogue needed.''

Einar promises to make you some boots if you bring him three pieces of [[Crushed Black Marble]] and a pair of [[Eroded Leather Boots]].

